      "renderedArtWindows": "Client PALM_THRUST_ANIM (GameFighter) draws palm-thrust-smear 0-40ms, palm-thrust.png 40-460ms, palm-thrust-startup.png from 460ms. Server phases are startup [0,90), active [90,180), recovery [180,500) on whiff. The authorized limb window ends at PALM_THRUST_HOLD_MS into recovery (440ms from move start) — 20ms BEFORE the art retracts, so authority can never advertise reach the sprite is not drawing."
    }
